{"title":"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Given a quadrilateral <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> inscribed in a circle with side <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> extended beyond <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> to point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/1/4b19f66565f1574f8df1e0d24f7f0c679b68507a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\measuredangle BAD=92^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"105\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/a/b5a6ac661194ef139b2f455e5f5212ef9468fe14.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\measuredangle ADC=68^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"104\" height=\"13\" />, find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/b/f3bbfc9e859e9db1083792c6039fe6805e828ef5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\measuredangle EBC$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/f/e0fc88a1583ef451dc23eaea58dc083f91fd537d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)\\ } 66^\\circ \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ }68^\\circ \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\  } 70^\\circ \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\  } 88^\\circ \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\  }92^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"424\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> is cyclic, opposite angles must sum to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/4/c4460b5100c3ce982ab5ebb20a8c3871e9cfdc54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$180^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"33\" height=\"13\" />. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/d/95d91c8491f58bc3225bc56c5f475ba3f5d39de1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ADC+\\angle ABC=180^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"191\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/3/bb34933da9f4e89680f1f88c2f0586530992d959.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ABC=180^\\circ-\\angle ADC=180^\\circ-68^\\circ=112^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"357\" height=\"13\" />. Notice also that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/a/a3ad57710b6810476e6017ea2c2cc6d41219c218.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"57\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/e/daebbb6bd008fc0041abc19fc3b6e9f866b828d8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle CBE$\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" /> form a linear pair, and so they sum to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/4/c4460b5100c3ce982ab5ebb20a8c3871e9cfdc54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$180^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"33\" height=\"13\" />. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/c/15c120baeb52d96cd6101dc38c7298e5f33db3df.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle EBC=180^\\circ-\\angle ABC=180^\\circ-112^\\circ=68^\\circ, \\boxed{\\text{B}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"391\" height=\"23\" />. Notice that the answer didn't even depend on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/5/cb55dc9c50a80e1d9eb23fe53e45f464c0ac755e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle BAD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"59\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME\" title=\"1974 AHSME\">1974 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1974 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1974\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?titl